   "source": [
    "# LSTM 坐姿趋势预测\n\n## 实验目标\n- 使用LSTM对坐姿时序数据进行预测\n- 预测未来24步的坐姿趋势\n\n## 算法原理\nLSTM（长短期记忆网络）通过遗忘门-输入门-输出门机制解决传统RNN的梯度消失问题。在项目中用于预测坐姿趋势。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\nfrom sqlalchemy import create_engine\nimport tensorflow as tf\nfrom tensorflow.keras.models import Sequential\nfrom tensorflow.keras.layers import LSTM, Dense, Dropout\nfrom tensorflow.keras.callbacks import EarlyStopping\nprint(f\"TF {tf.__version__}\")\n\nengine = create_engine(\"mysql+pymysql://root:Wj686866@localhost:3306/smart_posture\")\ndf = pd.read_sql(\"SELECT * FROM posture_records WHERE user_id=1 ORDER BY created_at\", engine)\nprint(f\"{len(df)} records loaded\")"
   ],
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. 数据预处理\n将时间序列转为监督学习格式：前seq_len条预测下一条"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "metrics = [\"head_angle\",\"shoulder_diff\",\"hunchback_score\",\"body_tilt\",\"round_shoulder\"]\ndata_raw = df[metrics].values.astype(np.float32)\n\nscaler = StandardScaler()\ndata_norm = scaler.fit_transform(data_raw)\n\nseq_len = 20\nX, y = [], []\nfor i in range(len(data_norm) - seq_len):\n    X.append(data_norm[i:i+seq_len])\n    y.append(data_norm[i+seq_len])\nX = np.array(X)\ny = np.array(y)\nprint(f\"X shape: {X.shape}\")\nprint(f\"y shape: {y.shape}\")"
   ],
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. 构建双层LSTM模型"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "model = Sequential([\n    LSTM(64, activation=\"tanh\", return_sequences=True, input_shape=(seq_len, 5)),\n    Dropout(0.2),\n    LSTM(32, activation=\"tanh\"),\n    Dropout(0.2),\n    Dense(5)\n])\nmodel.compile(optimizer=\"adam\", loss=\"mse\")\nmodel.summary()"
   ],
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. 训练（80%训练，20%验证，Early Stopping）"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "split = int(len(X) * 0.8)\nX_train, X_val = X[:split], X[split:]\ny_train, y_val = y[:split], y[split:]\n\nhistory = model.fit(\n    X_train, y_train,\n    validation_data=(X_val, y_val),\n    epochs=30, batch_size=32,\n    callbacks=[EarlyStopping(patience=5, restore_best_weights=True)],\n    verbose=1\n)\n\nplt.figure(figsize=(8,4))\nplt.plot(history.history[\"loss\"], label=\"train\")\nplt.plot(history.history[\"val_loss\"], label=\"val\")\nplt.xlabel(\"Epoch\")\nplt.ylabel(\"MSE\")\nplt.legend()\nplt.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\nplt.title(\"LSTM Training\")\nplt.show()"
   ],
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. 滚动预测未来24步"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "current = data_norm[-seq_len:].copy()\npreds = []\nfor _ in range(24):\n    inp = current[-seq_len:].reshape(1, seq_len, -1)\n    p = model.predict(inp, verbose=0)[0]\n    preds.append(p)\n    current = np.vstack([current, p.reshape(1, -1)])\npred_arr = scaler.inverse_transform(np.array(preds))\n\nfig, axes = plt.subplots(3,2,figsize=(14,10))\naxes = axes.flatten()\ntitles = [\"Head Angle\",\"Shoulder Diff\",\"Hunchback\",\"Body Tilt\",\"Round Shoulder\"]\nfor i in range(5):\n    axes[i].plot(range(50), data_raw[-50:,i], c=\"#667eea\", label=\"history\")\n    axes[i].plot(range(50,74), pred_arr[:,i], c=\"#f56c6c\", linestyle=\"--\", marker=\"o\", ms=3, label=\"pred\")\n    axes[i].set_title(titles[i])\n    axes[i].axvline(x=49, color=\"gray\", linestyle=\":\")\n    axes[i].legend()\n    axes[i].grid(True, alpha=0.3)\naxes[5].axis(\"off\")\nplt.suptitle(\"LSTM Prediction (50 history + 24 future)\", y=1.02)\nplt.tight_layout()\nplt.show()"
   ],
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 结论\n\n| 项目 | 配置 |\n|------|------|\n| 模型结构 | LSTM(64)->LSTM(32)->Dense(5) |\n| 输入 | 20步序列 (~10分钟) |\n| 输出 | 预测24步 (~12分钟) |\n| 部署 | model_manager.save_model() -> .pkl |\n\n**局限性**：数据量不足时预测能力有限；长期预测误差累积。\n**优化方向**：增加真实数据量；引入Attention机制；多步直接预测。"
   ]
  }
